        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-13T18:11:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>At present, all the card text remains. In the app, the card is basically \"scheduled\" to go underneath Savage Mana, and doesn't actually go underneath until all is said and done. That means that if you could use Savage Mana's power during the destruction (e.g. by Dynamic Siphon), it would not get destroyed again (because it's not underneath it yet).</p><p>Not saying that's an official ruling - it's just how it works right now in the app.</p>",
        "post_number": 22,
