        "created_at": "2015-03-13T18:17:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well the app counts as official unless stated otherwise, so that's how I'm going to run it.</p><p>That works almost exactly how I normally resolve it. &nbsp;I treat all other destruction effects as pending until the self destruct text resolves.</p>",
